### Créer un event
POST http://localhost:8080/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Event 3",
  "description": "Just a test",
  "startDate": "2026-05-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-05-17T18:00:00Z",
  "location": "Test Location"
}

### Lister tous les events
GET http://localhost:8080/events

### Récupérer un event par ID (remplacer {id} par un vrai ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/events/{id}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/speakers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alexandre Moreau",
  "role": "Expert en Intelligence Artificielle",
  "specialty": "IA",
  "company": "TechVision",
